# Verify current state before reporting

Before calling work active, reviewed, built or shipped, check its current
activity, source/remote state and relevant receipts. An old owner note or
silent agent is not proof of liveness; inspect and resume interrupted authorized
work when appropriate. Do not kill or restart a live job based only on age.
Keep authorized work moving. See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
